  "code" : "public int[] countGreaterRight(int[] nums) {\n    int n = nums.length;\n    int[] result = new int[n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < n; j++) {\n            if (nums[j] > nums[i]) {\n                count++;\n            }\n        }\n        result[i] = count;\n    }\n    return result;\n}",
